msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Liste de contrôle de migration"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:204
msgid "For a clean port to v3.9.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr ""
"Pour un portage propre vers la v3.9.0, le travail habituel est le suivant :"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:206
msgid ""
"Port CMSIS-NN ``nn`` model inference to the TensorFlow Lite ``tf`` module "
"(:ref:`the nn removal <v3_9_0_nn>`)."
msgstr ""
"Portez l'inférence des modèles CMSIS-NN ``nn`` vers le module TensorFlow "
"Lite ``tf`` (:ref:`la suppression de nn <v3_9_0_nn>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:208
msgid ""
"Replace ``image.ImageReader`` / ``image.ImageWriter`` with "
":class:`image.ImageIO` (:ref:`the ImageIO change <v3_9_0_imageio>`)."
msgstr ""
"Remplacez ``image.ImageReader`` / ``image.ImageWriter`` par "
":class:`image.ImageIO` (:ref:`le changement ImageIO <v3_9_0_imageio>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:210
msgid ""
"Drop the ``scale=(min, max)`` keyword from :func:`fir.draw_ir` and use the "
"new arguments (:ref:`the draw_ir change <v3_9_0_fir_draw_ir>`)."
msgstr ""
"Supprimez le mot-clé ``scale=(min, max)`` de :func:`fir.draw_ir` et utilisez"
" les nouveaux arguments (:ref:`le changement de draw_ir "
"<v3_9_0_fir_draw_ir>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:212
msgid ""
"Re-tune ``find_lines()`` parameters against the approximate magnitude metric"
" (:ref:`the find_lines change <v3_9_0_find_lines>`)."
msgstr ""
"Recalibrez les paramètres de ``find_lines()`` par rapport à la métrique de "
"magnitude approximative (:ref:`le changement de find_lines "
"<v3_9_0_find_lines>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:214
msgid ""
"Port FIR scripts to the new :func:`fir.snapshot` keyword API (:ref:`the "
"fir.snapshot change <v3_9_0_fir_snapshot>`) and handle :func:`fir.init` "
"raising on a missing sensor (:ref:`the fir.init change <v3_9_0_fir_init>`)."
msgstr ""
"Portez les scripts FIR vers la nouvelle API à mots-clés de "
":func:`fir.snapshot` (:ref:`le changement de fir.snapshot "
"<v3_9_0_fir_snapshot>`) et gérez la levée d'exception de :func:`fir.init` en"
" cas de capteur absent (:ref:`le changement de fir.init <v3_9_0_fir_init>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:219
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "Tous les autres scripts fonctionnent sans modification."
